5:T45c,Vest made of genuine, high-quality, soft lamb nappa leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.0 mm.
The vest is black
The vest can be closed with a zipper.
Featuring many inside and outside pockets, finished with zippers or Velcro closures
Right side: A deep, zippered chest pocket with a smaller sewn-on pocket with a hook-and-loop closure. Below, a large zippered pocket with two further sewn-on pockets, one with a zipper and the other with hook-and-loop closure. A side pocket located behind the lower large pocket.
Left side: A deep patch chest pocket with a Velcro closure and a smaller sewn-on pocket with a Velcro closure. Below, a large zippered pocket with two further sewn-on pockets, one with a zipper and the other with Velcro closures. A side pocket is located behind the lower large pocket.
Two deep inner pockets, both with a zipper closure.
There is a D-ring metal eyelet on both sides at the top and on the back for attaching various hooks or a towel.
There is an adjustment buckle on both sides.
Also ideal for club logos and/or patches.
The inner lining is made of polyester.6:T45c,Vest made of genuine, high-quality, soft lamb nappa leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.0 mm.
The vest is brown
The vest can be closed with a zipper.
Featuring many inside and outside pockets, finished with zippers or Velcro closures
Right side: A deep, patch chest pocket with a zipper and a smaller sewn-on pocket with a Velcro closure.
Below is a large zippered pocket with two additional sewn-on pockets, one with a zipper and the other with Velcro closure.
A side pocket located behind the lower large pocket
Left side: A deep patch chest pocket with Velcro closure and a smaller sewn-on pocket with Velcro closure.
Below is a large zippered pocket with two additional sewn-on pockets, one with a zipper and the other with Velcro closure.
A side pocket located behind the lower large pocket
Two deep inner pockets, both with a zipper closure.
There is a D-ring metal eyelet on both sides at the top and on the back for attaching various hooks or a towel.
There is an adjustment buckle on both sides.
Also ideal for club logos and/or patches.
The inner lining is made of polyester.7:T427,The men's Club motorcycle leather vest impresses with its first-class craftsmanship and classic design. Crafted from genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm, it guarantees durability and comfort. The simple, black base color gives it a timeless look.

A sturdy zipper closure ensures the vest can be securely and conveniently closed. Inside, there are two practical inner pockets, ideal for safely storing important items such as a smartphone or wallet.

This vest comes without outer pockets and boasts a smooth design, as it has no seams on the front or back – perfect for patches and club logos. Made from three continuous pieces of leather, it offers a particularly elegant and authentic appearance.

Genuine cowhide leather

Leather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm

Soft nappa leather

The base color of the leather is black

The inner lining is made of polyester

No outer pockets

Ideal for patches and club logos

No seams at the front or back

2 inside pockets

Slightly shorter at the back

To prevent the vest from bulging while riding8:T463,Vest made of genuine, high-quality, soft lambskin nappa leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.0 mm.

The vest is black and has a suede finish.

The vest has a zipper closure.

With numerous inside and outside pockets, with zipper or Velcro closure.

Right side: A deep patch chest pocket with a zipper closure and a small patch pocket with a Velcro closure. Below, a large zippered pocket with two additional patch pockets, one with a zipper and the other with a Velcro closure. A side pocket located behind the lower large pocket.

Left side: A deep patch chest pocket with a Velcro closure and a small patch pocket with a Velcro closure. Below, a large zippered pocket with two additional patch pockets, one with a zipper and the other with a Velcro closure. A side pocket located behind the lower large pocket.

Two deep inside pockets, both with a zipper closure.

A D-shaped metal eyelet on both sides of the top and on the back for various accessories. Hooks or for attaching a towel

Buckles on both sides for adjustment

Also ideal for club logos and/or patches

