r Vest Hunter Club Jacket Black/Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nThe upper part was quilted with a checkered pattern.\r\nA polyester filling has been sewn under the quilted pattern to make the pattern more visible.\r\nThe lower part is made of perforated cowhide leather.\r\nAll decorative seams are in red.\r\n2 outer pockets with concealed snap closure\r\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly lower.\r\nSo that the patches fit on the front.\r\nExpandable at the sides via zippers\r\nExtendable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded off by 5 cm.\r\nSo that the vest doesn't stick out while driving","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-5.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9201","slug":"men-s-black-camo-vest-with-perforated-leather-pcp-lv-9201","name":"Men's black camo vest with perforated leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nThe upper part is dyed in a camo pattern.\r\nThe lower part is made of perforated cowhide leather.\r\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closure\r\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly lower.\r\nSo that the patches fit on the front.\r\nExpandable at the sides via zippers\r\nExtendable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded off by 5 cm.\r\nSo that the vest doesn't stick out while driving","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-5.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-900","slug":"motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-with-carabiner-pcp-lv-900","name":"Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest with Carabiner","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\r\nThe vest is black and has been finished with black leather cord.\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as leather milk, leather cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can also wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have 3 chrome-plated buckles as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Ge