is ideal for patches.\r\nno annoying means back seam","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9079-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9079-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9079-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9079-4.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9202","slug":"black-camouflage-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9202","name":"Black Camouflage Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nWith a camo coloring\r\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closure\r\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly lower.\r\nSo that the patches fit on the front.\r\nExpandable at the sides via zippers\r\nExtendable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded off by 5 cm.\r\nSo that the vest doesn't stick out while driving","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9202-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9202-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9202-3.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9105","slug":"men-s-biker-buckle-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9105","name":"Men's Biker Buckle Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm.\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nLaced on both sides (expandable up to 5 cm on each side)\r\nThe vest was braided around the edges with leather cords.\r\nAdjustable via 3 buckles on the sides\r\n3 chrome carabiners as closures\r\n2 zippered outer pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nNo center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9105-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9105-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9105-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9105-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9105-5.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9230","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-in-croco-look-made-of-cowhide-black-red-pcp-lv-9230","name":"Men’s Biker Leather Vest in Croco Look made of cowhide, Black / Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1 – 1.2 mm\n\nBase color black and red\n\nUpper section with diamond stitching (checkered pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under the stitching for better structure\n\nEntire vest with croco embossing for an exclusive look\n\n2 outer pockets with snap button\n\n2 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nExtra-deep stitched inner pockets – ideal for more storage and for sewing patches on the front\n\nSides expandable by up to 5 cm with zippers\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack sewn in one piece – perfect for patches or club logos. No protruding seam.\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so the vest doesn’t stick out while riding\n\nInner lining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9230-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9231","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-club-kutte-with-croco-embossing-black-red-pcp-lv-9231","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Hunter Club Kutte with Croco Embossing Black / Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBase color black or red\n\nUpper section with diamond stitching (checkered pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under the stitching for better structure\n\nFront with croco embossing for an exclusive look\n\nNo outer pockets – ideal for side rocker patches\n\n4 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nExtra-deep stitched inner pockets – ideal for more storage and so patches can be sewn on the front\n\nSides expandable by up to 5 cm with zippers\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack sewn in one piece – perfect for patches or club logos. No protruding seam.\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so the vest doesn’t stick out while riding\n\nInner lining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9231-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9228","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-biker-cut-motorcycle-waistcoat-camouflage-black-grey-perforated-pcp-lv-9228","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Biker Cut Motorcycle Waistcoat Camouflage Black Grey Perforated","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather – premium quality, durable and long-lasting\n\nLeather thickness: approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBase color: black-grey camouflage look\n\nPerforated leather – ensures breathability and comfort, even in summer\n\nStrong metal front zipper for secure closure\n\n4 inside pockets – one with zipper, all extra deep for storage and front patch application\n\nExpandable sides with zippers (up to 5 cm each) – adjustable fit\n\nBack without center seam – perfect for patches and club logos\n\nRounded back hem (approx. 5 cm) – prevents vest from lifting while riding\n\nLining: durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9228-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9229","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-club-kutte-with-croco-embossing-pcp-lv-9229","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Hunter Club Kutte with Croco Embossing","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1–1.2 mm\n\nBase colour black\n\nUpper section with diamond quilting (check pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under quilting for better structure\n\nFront with croco embossing for exclusive look\n\nWithout outer pockets, ideal for side rockers\n\n4 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nInner pockets sewn extra deep – ideal for more storage and to allow patches on the front\n\nSide zippers expandable by 5 cm each side\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack smooth without centre seam – perfect for patches or club logos\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so vest does not stick out when riding\n\nLining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9229-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9224","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-expandable-sides-black-closures-pcp-lv-9224","name":"Men’s Leather Vest with Expandable Sides, Black Closures","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Closure: 3 sturdy buckles (carabiner style) at the front\n\nExpandable: Side zippers allow up to 5 cm expansion on each side\n\nPockets: 2 outer pockets and 2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nLining: Durable polyester\n\nBack: No annoying center seam – perfect for patches and embroidery","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9224-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-913","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-orange-cords-pcp-lv-913","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Orange Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features orange leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-913-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-915","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-blue-trim-pcp-lv-915","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Blue Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with yellow trim\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-915-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-942","slug":"men-s-used-look-leather-vest-pcp-lv-942","name":"Men's Used Look Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black/antique gray with a black leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on both sides, so you can also wear it over your jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-942-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-914","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-yellow-trim-pcp-lv-914","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Yellow Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with yellow trim\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for fastening\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-914-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9164","slug":"dark-blue-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9164","name":"Dark Blue Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is dark blue\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n3 chrome buckles close the vest\n\nLaced at the sides\n\nExtends up to 5 cm on each side\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cord\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nNo center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9164-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-956","slug":"nubuck-brown-men-s-biker-leather-vest-p