ntage Leather Vest Jeans Style","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been treated with a distressed look\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nFour outer pockets, the chest pockets close with snap fasteners\n\nThe vest closes on both sides\n\nIt has a zipper closure\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nWindproof thanks to a piece of leather that covers the closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9137-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9007","slug":"biker-leather-vest-without-pockets-ideal-for-side-rockers-pcp-lv-9007","name":"Biker leather vest without pockets, ideal for side rockers","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nBlack base color.\n\nClosed on both sides.\n\nNo outer pockets.\n\nTwo inner pockets, one with a zipper.\n\nNo center back seam, ideal for patches.\n\nInner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9007-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-995","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-995","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest fastens with buckles.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nClosed at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-995-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9169","slug":"black-leather-vest-without-fasteners-pcp-lv-9169","name":"Black Leather Vest without Fasteners","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is braided with a leather cord.\n\nFor a unique look.\n\nIdeal for custom fastenings.\n\nThe vest has no fasteners.\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\n2 inside pockets.\n\nExpandable by lacing up to 5 cm on each side.\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over a jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9169-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9163","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-pcp-lv-9163","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\n1.1 to 1.2 mm thick\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nAn eagle embossed into the leather on the back\n\n10 adjustable buckles\n\n3 buckles for closure\n\nThe vest is lined with leather cords on the sides\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe vest is woven with leather cords\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9163-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9161","slug":"vintage-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-buckles-pcp-lv-9161","name":"Vintage Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe leather has been treated for a vintage look\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n2 outer pockets\n\n2 inner pockets\n\nOne inner pocket has a zipper closure\n\nThe other inner pocket has a snap fastener\n\nThe back panel has an eagle embossing\n\nThe embossing was punched into the leather from the inside\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on each side\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the drawstring\n\nTo prevent the vest from inflating while riding\n\n3 buckles for the vest closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9161-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9162","slug":"camouflage-men-s-leather-vest-with-buckles-pcp-lv-9162","name":"Camouflage Men's Leather Vest with Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe surface is dyed in a camouflage pattern.\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper).\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\nSides are expandable with zippers.\n\nExpandable by up to 5 cm per side.\n\nNo center back seam.\n\nIdeal for patches.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9162-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-977","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-side-laces-pcp-lv-977","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Side Laces","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This men's leather vest is made of genuine and durable cowhide.\n\nLaced on both sides.\n\nIdeal for patches, meaning there's no center seam on the back.\n\nThe inside pockets are slightly deeper, allowing the front of the chest to accommodate patches without sewing the inside pocket.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nThree chrome buckles close the vest.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides.\n\nPlease refer to the size chart in the images.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-977-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9156","slug":"men-s-snap-button-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9156","name":"Men's Snap-Button Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\n2 exterior pockets\n\n2 interior pockets\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n4 snap fasteners\n\nExtends by 5 cm on both sides","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9156-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9155","slug":"buckle-biker-leather-vest-made-of-buffalo-nubuck-leather-pcp-lv-9155","name":"Buckle Biker Leather Vest Made of Buffalo Nubuck Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine Buffalo Nubuck Leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nLaced on both sides (extendable up to 5 cm per side)\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords\n\nAdjustable with 3 buckles on the sides\n\n3 brass snap hooks for closure\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets\n\nNo center back seam","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9155-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9149","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-biker-in-red-snake-pattern-pcp-lv-9149","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest Biker in Red Snake Pattern","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe surface has been dyed\n\nFor a unique look\n\nNo annoying seam at the front\n\nNo front pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inside pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam at the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9149-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9146","slug":"buffalo-nubuck-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9146","name":"Buffalo Nubuck Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine nubuck buffalo leather\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over a jacket\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 of which are chest pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one with a zipper\n\nAll zippers are from YKK\n\nPlease refer to the size chart","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9146-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9145","slug":"motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-with-velcro-custom-vest-pcp-lv-9145","name":"Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest with Velcro Custom Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The lower part of the vest is made of nubuck buffalo leather.\n\nThe upper part is made of cowhide nappa leather.\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\n4 outer pockets with zippers.\n\n2 inner pockets, one with zipper.\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the main zipper.\n\nTo make the vest windproof.\n\nThe inner lining is made of a cotton blend.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on the sides with Velcro fasteners.\n\nIdeal for patches.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9145-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9141","slug":"men-s-fringe-leather-vest-with-conchos-side-laces-pcp-lv-9141","name":"Men's Fringe Leather Vest with Conchos, Side Laces","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The lower section is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe upper section is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords.\n\nFringes on the back and front.\n\nThe vest is braided on the sides.\n\n4 conchos for closure.\n\n2 exterior pockets.\n\n2 interior pockets.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9141-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9059","slug":"men-s-studded-buckle-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9059","name":"Men's Studded Buckle Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Stylish biker leather vest with beautiful stud decoration.\n\nAll rivets are riveted through the vest.\n\nGenuine and thick cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm.\n\n3 buckles on the sides and 2 on each shoulder.\n\nEach buckle has 5 adjustment options.\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles (carabiner) as closures.\n\n2 exterior pockets with flaps.\n\nThis flap can also be hidden inside the pocket.\n\n2 interior pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe entire vest has a checked pattern.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest has a light cotton filling to accentuate the checked look.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9059-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9140","slug":"men-s-fringe-leather-vest-with-conchos-pcp-lv-9140","name":"Men's Fringe Leather Vest with Conchos","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The lower part is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe upper part is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords.\n\nFringes on the back and front.\n\nThe vest is fastened on the sides.\n\n4 conchos as closures.\n\n2 exterior pockets.\n\n2 interior pockets.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9140-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9139","slug":"men-s-fringe-leather-vest-with-buckles-pcp-lv-9139","name":"Men's Fringe Leather Vest with Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The lower part is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe upper part is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords.\n\nFringes on the back and front.\n\nThe vest is laced up on the sides.\n\n3 snap hooks for closure.\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\n2 inside pockets.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9139-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9138","slug":"men-s-fringe-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9138","name":"Men's Fringe Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The lower part is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe upper part is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords.\n\nFringes on the back and front.\n\nThe vest is fastened on the sides.\n\n3 snap hooks for closure.\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\n2 ins