h has a zipper\n\nNo side drawstrings\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9036-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9030","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-inside-and-out-pcp-lv-9030","name":"Men's Leather Vest, Inside and Out","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide leather on the outside.\n\nThe inside is also made of genuine cowhide leather.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles.\n\n2 outside pockets with snap fasteners.\n\n2 inside pockets.\n\nLaced at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9030-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9028","slug":"biker-men-s-leather-vest-with-a-zipper-pcp-lv-9028","name":"Biker Men's Leather Vest with a Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nNo seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos\n\n3 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets, one with a zipper\n\nZipper closure\n\nAll zippers are from YKK","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9028-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9026","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9026","name":"Men's Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"VEST MADE OF GENUINE, ROBUST COWHIDE LEATHER, WITH A LEATHER THICKNESS OF APPROXIMATELY 1.1 TO 1.2 MM\n\nTHE VEST IS BLACK AND HAS BEEN FINISHED WITH LEATHER CORD\n\nALSO IDEAL FOR CLUB LOGO AND/OR PATCHES\n\nTHE INNER LINING IS MADE OF POLYESTER\n\nTWO CHEST POCKETS, CLOSED WITH A SNAP STUD\n\nTHE LEATHER REMAINS SUPPLE AND PERMANENTLY SOFT.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt features three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets and two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9026-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-920","slug":"men-s-vintage-leather-vest-pcp-lv-920","name":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is dark brown and has been finished with brown accents to create a vintage pattern.\n\nThe vest is braided all around with genuine leather.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather stays supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest is fastened on both sides with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, both with zippers, and two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-920-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9176","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-nubuck-and-cowhide-pcp-lv-9176","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest / Nubuck & Cowhide","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine leather.\n\nThe lower part is made of cowhide (1.1 to 1.2 mm thick).\n\nThe upper part is made of nubuck buffalo leather (also 1.1 to 1.2 mm thick).\n\nBoth leather types are black.\n\nThe biker vest is sewn with a cowhide band around the waist.\n\nThe vest is expandable on the sides with a zipper.\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side.\n\nThis allows you to wear the vest over a jacket.\n\nThe vest has two pockets on the outside and two inside (one of which has a zipper).\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9176-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-1083","slug":"biker-shirt-waistcoat-with-short-sleeves-perforated-leather-pcp-lv-1083","name":"Biker Shirt / Waistcoat With Short Sleeves Perforated Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather exterior\n\nThick yet soft cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nPerforated leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\n3 outside zip pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (1x press stud pocket / 1x zip pocket)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe waistcoat / shirt is closed with a zip fastener\n\nAll zips are from the YKK brand\n\nSewn-in shoulder / back pleat for better mobility\n\n2 slits on the sides also for better mobility\n\nNo annoying centre back seam / ideal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-1083-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9006","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9006","name":"Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nFour outer pockets, the chest pockets close with snap fasteners\n\nThe vest closes on both sides\n\nIt has a zipper closure\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nWindproof thanks to a piece of leather that covers the closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9006-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9055","slug":"rough-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-9055","name":"Rough Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 chrome-plated buckles (snap hooks) for closure\n\nGenuine cowhide (rough leather)\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nRough leather is very comfortable to wear (thick yet soft leather)\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 8 cm on the sides thanks to lacing (per side)\n\nThe vest is finished with cords around the waist\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe vest is ideal for patches\n\nNo annoying center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9055-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9147","slug":"white-crocodile-biker-mc-cowhide-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9147","name":"White Crocodile Biker MC Cowhide Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is white\n\nThe surface has been punched for the unique crocodile look\n\nNo annoying seam at the front\n\nNo front pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inside pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam at the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9147-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9184","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-in-classic-denim-vest-style-without-a-collar-pcp-lv-9184","name":"Motorcycle leather vest in classic denim vest style without a collar","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest has no collar\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nFour outer pockets, the chest pockets are closed with snap fasteners\n\nThe vest closes on both sides\n\nIt has a zipper closure\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nWindproof thanks to a leather patch that covers the closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9184-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-948","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-with-zipper-pcp-lv-948","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest with Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nThe vest is quilted on both shoulders.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\n\n\nThere is a large zipper to close the vest.\n\nThere is a piece of leather under the zipper, making the vest windproof.\n\nTwo outer pockets with zippers, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-948-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9157","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-orange-cords-pcp-lv-9157","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Orange Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick leather\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest is braided with orange leather cords.\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nClosed on both sides\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9157-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9187","slug":"men-s-clubstyle-leather-vest-with-quilted-shoulders-pcp-lv-9187","name":"Men's Clubstyle Leather Vest with Quilted Shoulders","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine leather on the outside.\n\nThe lower part is made of black buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nThe upper part is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nBoth leather types have a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nFour exterior pockets, the chest pockets, are closed with snap fasteners.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.\n\nIt has a zipper.\n\nTwo deep interior pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nWindproof thanks to a leather patch that covers the closure.\n\nThe highlight of the vest is the quilted shoulders.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9187-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-982","slug":"men-s-chopper-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-982","name":"Men's Chopper Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is brown.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest is closed with three chrome buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides (so the hood can also be worn over the jacket).\n\nVery easy to care for and maintain.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-982-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9212","slug":"men-s-crocodile-look-leather-vest-red-pcp-lv-9212","name":"Men's Crocodile-Look Leather Vest, Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is red with a light black accent\n\nThe surface is punched for a unique crocodile look\n\nNo annoying seams at the front\n\nNo front pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inside pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam on the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9212-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-980","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-980","name":"Men's Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This men's leather vest is made of genuine and durable cowhide.\n\nLaced on both sides.\n\nIdeal for patches, meaning there's no center seam on the back.\n\nThe inside pockets are slightly deeper, allowing the front of the chest to accommodate patches without sewing the inside pocket.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nThree chrome buckles close the vest.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides.\n\nPlease refer to the size chart in the images.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-980-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-996","slug":"motorcycle-nubuck-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-996","name":"Motorcycle Nubuck Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust nubuck buffalo leather with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is brown.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest can be closed with buckles.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nLaced at the sides.","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-996-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-978","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-zipper-pcp-lv-978","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This men's leather vest is made of genuine and durable cowhide.\n\nZippers are adjustable on both sides.\n\nIdeal for patches, so there's no center seam on the back.\n\nThe inside pockets are slightly deeper, allowing the patches to fit on the front of the chest without having to sew the inside pocket.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nZipper closure.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides.\n\nPlease refer to the size chart in the images.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-978-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9168","slug":"buckled-leather-vest-with-expandable-zipper-pcp-lv-9168","name":"Buckled Leather Vest with Expandable Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Leather vest made of genuine cowhide\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft cowhide\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe inner lining of the vest is made of polyester\n\nThe vest has two pockets on the outside\n\nTwo inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper\n\nThe vest is finished with leather cording\n\nFor a unique look\n\nThree chrome-plated buckles close the vest\n\nThere is a zipper on the sides for expansion\n\nEach side allows you to expand the vest by 5 cm\n\nThat means up to 10 cm more circumference\n\nThis allows you to wear the vest over your jacket\n\nNo annoying back seam\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9168-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9177","slug":"leather-cowl-with-belt-strap-closure-pcp-lv-9177","name":"Leather cowl with belt strap closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The cowl is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nLaced at the sides.\n\nTwo buckles on each side for adjustment.\n\nFour belt straps at the front for closure.\n\nAll straps are firmly riveted through the leather.\n\nTwo inside pockets.\n\nOne inside pocket has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9177-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9035","slug":"camouflage-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9035","name":"Camouflage Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is dyed camouflage and finished with a black leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has a zipper closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9035-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-961","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-961","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is brown.\n\nThe vest has leather drawstrings all around.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nThe vest fastens with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides (so you can also wear the vest over your jacket).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-961-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-973","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-eagle-embossment-pcp-lv-973","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Eagle Embossment","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 10 mm. 1.1 TO 1.2 MM\n\nTHE VEST IS BROWN AND EMBOSSED WITH AN EAGLE\n\nTHE VEST HAS LEATHER STRIPS ALL THE WAY AROUND\n\nIDEAL FOR CLUB LOGOS AND/OR PATCHES\n\nTHE VEST IS CLOSED WITH 3 CHROME BUCKLES\n\nTWO OUTER POCKETS, TWO DEEP INSIDE POCKETS, ONE OF WHICH HAS A ZIPPER\n\nTHE LINING IS MADE OF POLYESTER\n\nTHE VEST CAN BE EXTENDED BY UP TO 5 CM ON BOTH SIDES (THUS THE VEST CAN ALSO BE WORN OVER A JACKET)\n\nVERY EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-973-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-960","slug":"motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-960","name":"Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nThe vest has leather drawstrings all around.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nThe vest closes with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides (so you can also wear the vest over your jacket).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be cared for with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-960-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-955","slug":"nubuck-biker-men-s-leather-vest-with-side-closure-pcp-lv-955","name":"Nubuck Biker Men's Leather Vest with Side Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust buffalo nubuck leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nThe vest fastens with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is fastened on both sides.","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-955-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-953","slug":"nubuck-men-s-biker-leather-vest-in-matte-black-pcp-lv-953","name":"Nubuck Men's Biker Leather Vest in Matte Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust nubuck buffalo leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nThe vest fastens with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides.","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-953-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9081","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-pcp-lv-9081","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nNappa cowhide (thick yet soft)\n\nA light eagle embossing on the back (punched from the inside)\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords all around\n\nDouble-braided in certain places (see picture)\n\n2 exterior pockets\n\n2 interior pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles for closure (all rivets are through-riveted)","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9081-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-952","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-side-closure-pcp-lv-952","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Side Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for.\n\nThe vest fastens with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is fastened on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-952-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-992","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-skull-laser-engraving-pcp-lv-992","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Skull Laser Engraving","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nLaser-engraved into the leather.\n\nThe vest can be closed with buckles.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nLased at the sides.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides (so the hood can also be worn over a jacket).","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-992-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9131","slug":"men-s-vintage-biker-leather-vest-with-brass-buckles-pcp-lv-9131","name":"Men's Vintage Biker Leather Vest with Brass Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color is brown\n\nThe surface has been dyed black (vintage/used look)\n\nLaced on both sides (extendable up to 5 cm per side)\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords\n\nAdjustable with 3 buckles on the sides\n\n3 brass snap hooks for closure\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets\n\nNo center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9131-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9072","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-brass-buckles-pcp-lv-9072","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Brass Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\n1.2 mm thick\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe top layer is dyed black\n\nThis creates a unique brown-black look\n\nThe vest is finished with leather cords (black/brown)\n\nNo center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches\n\nThe vest can be extended with laces on both sides\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9072-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-949","slug":"custom-biker-leather-motorcycle-vest-pcp-lv-949","name":"Custom Biker Leather Motorcycle Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nThe vest is quilted on both shoulders.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\n\n\nThere is a large zipper for closing the vest.\n\nThere is a piece of leather under the zipper, making the vest windproof.\n\nTwo outer pockets with zippers, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest has adjustable Velcro fasteners on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-949-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9143","slug":"gray-vintage-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9143","name":"Gray Vintage Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nLaced at the sides\n\nExtends by 5 cm on each side\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nUnique vintage coloring\n\nThe vest is braided with a gray leather band around the waist\n\nNo annoying seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches\n\nThe vest is made of genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is gray\n\nThe leather has been treated with a vintage effect\n\nFor a unique retro look","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9143-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-947","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-with-zippered-pockets-pcp-lv-947","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest with Zippered Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets with zippers, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-947-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-946","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-patch-pockets-pcp-lv-946","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Patch Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has a leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as closures.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable on both sides, so you can also wear it over your jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-946-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9121","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-red-trim-pcp-lv-9121","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Red Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine leather (1.2 mm thick cowhide)\n\nThe base color is black\n\nThe vest features a trim around the waist\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\n2 exterior pockets\n\n2 interior pockets\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThere are zippers on the sides\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is no annoying seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9121-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9197","slug":"men-s-vintage-leather-vest-with-expandable-zipper-pcp-lv-9197","name":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest with Expandable Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 buckles (carabiner) closure, brass-look\n\nGenuine cowhide\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color is brown\n\nThe surface has been dyed black (vintage/used look)\n\nThe vest can be expanded by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the zipper (each side)\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe vest is ideal for patches\n\nNo annoying center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9197-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-945","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-pockets-pcp-lv-945","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as closures.\n\nThree outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-945-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9196","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-extensions-pcp-lv-9196","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Extensions","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe leather is hand-braided on the shoulders and back for a unique look.\n\nWith a stand-up collar.\n\nLeather windbreaker with snap fastener.\n\nZipper as the vest's main closure.\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the zipper (each side).\n\n4 exterior pockets, including 2 chest pockets. All exterior pockets have snap fasteners.\n\n2 interior pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe lining is made of sturdy polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9196-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9120","slug":"buckle-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9120","name":"Buckle Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather is thick yet soft\n\nThe base color is black\n\nThree exterior pockets\n\nTwo interior pockets\n\nOne interior pocket has a zipper\n\nAll exterior pockets can be closed with belt loops\n\nThere are three adjustable buckles on each shoulder\n\nThere are also three adjustable buckles on the sides\n\nThere are lacings under the straps to adjust the width\n\nAll straps/buckles are firmly riveted and therefore very durable\n\nThere are no annoying seams on the back\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9120-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9127","slug":"matte-black-buffalo-nubuck-leather-motorcycle-biker-vest-pcp-lv-9127","name":"Matte Black Buffalo Nubuck Leather Motorcycle Biker Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers.\n\n2 inner pockets, one with zipper.\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the main zipper.\n\nTo make the vest windproof.\n\nThe inner lining is made of a cotton blend.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on the sides with hook-and-loop fasteners.\n\nIdeal for patches.","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9127-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9194","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-9194","name":"Men's Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe surface has been lightly roughened for a unique, worn look\n\n2 exterior pockets with hidden snap closures\n\n2 interior pockets (one with a zipper)\n\nThe interior pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the front patches\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9194-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-944","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-orange-trim-pcp-lv-944","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Orange Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has an orange leather trim.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather stays supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on both sides, so you can also wear it over your jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-944-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-924","slug":"biker-leather-vest-in-gray-pcp-lv-924","name":"Biker Leather Vest in Gray","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is gray and features gray leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-924-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-941","slug":"brown-men-s-cowhide-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-941","name":"Brown Men's Cowhide Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather has a brown base color\n\nVintage brown (nice retro style)\n\nSide zips\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nNo center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches/club logos\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper\n\nThe vest has a leather trim made of brown braided cords","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-941-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9199","slug":"custom-biker-leather-vest-in-cracker-brown-pcp-lv-9199","name":"Custom Biker Leather Vest in Cracker Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is cracker brown\n\nThe upper part is quilted with a check pattern\n\nA polyester filling is sewn under the quilting to make the pattern more visible\n\n2 exterior pockets with hidden snap closures\n\n2 interior pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe interior pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches on the front","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9199-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9116","slug":"vintage-gray-men-s-leather-vest-biker-jacket-pcp-lv-9116","name":"Vintage Gray Men's Leather Vest Biker Jacket","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nLaced at the sides\n\nExtends by 5 cm on each side\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nUnique vintage coloring\n\nThe vest is braided with a gray leather band around the waist\n\nNo annoying seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches\n\nThe vest is made of genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is gray\n\nThe leather has been treated with a vintage effect\n\nFor a unique retro look","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9116-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9027","slug":"custom-zippered-motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-9027","name":"Custom Zippered Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color is black.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nTwo outer pockets with zippers.\n\nTwo inner pockets.\n\nZipper closure.\n\nAll fasteners are made of metal.\n\nNo annoying collar.\n\nVelcro straps on the side of the vest.\n\nFor an adjustable fit.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9027-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9115","slug":"men-s-biker-buckle-leather-vest-with-brass-buckles-pcp-lv-9115","name":"Men's Biker Buckle Leather Vest with Brass Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest is braided with leather straps all around\n\n3 brass snap hooks for closure\n\n2 adjustable buckles on each shoulder\n\n3 adjustable buckles on each side\n\nAll buckles and snap hooks are firmly riveted\n\nBoth sides can be extended by 5 cm\n\nBoth sides are also laced\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the laces\n\nAll buckles are the same color\n\nTwo outer pockets with zippers\n\nOne flap outer pocket (closable with snaps)\n\nTwo inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nNo annoying seams in the back\n\nIdeal for patches\n\n\n\nPlease refer to the size chart","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9115-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9148","slug":"crocodile-pattern-men-s-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-9148","name":"Crocodile Pattern Men's Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe surface has been punched for the unique crocodile look\n\nNo annoying seam at the front\n\nNo front pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inside pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam at the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9148-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9185","slug":"lightweight-men-s-lambskin-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9185","name":"Lightweight Men's Lambskin Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine lambskin nappa leather.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.0 mm.\n\nThe base color is black.\n\nThe vest has 6 exterior pockets.\n\n2 large pockets, 2 small chest pockets,\n\n1 large chest pocket, and a small shoulder pocket.\n\nThe inner lining is made of sturdy polyester.\n\nThere are also 2 large pockets inside.\n\nBoth interior pockets are equipped with zippers.\n\nThere are 3 hook-and-loop fasteners on each side for width adjustment.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9185-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9123","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-side-closure-pcp-lv-9123","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Side Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nwith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft cowhide\n\nThe base color of the vest is black\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n2 inside pockets\n\n2 outside pockets\n\nNo seams on the back\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos\n\nNo side lacing\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nAll buckles are riveted through the leather","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9123-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9109","slug":"vintage-men-s-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9109","name":"Vintage Men's Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe surface of the leather has been finished with a distressed look\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords\n\nTwo regular slit outer pockets\n\nTwo chest pockets with snap fasteners\n\nTwo zippered inner pockets\n\nTwo large inner pockets\n\nTwo small inner pockets\n\nThree brass snap hooks for closure\n\nA total of 16 buckles\n\n5 buckles on each side\n\n3 buckles on each shoulder\n\nAll buckles and buttons are brass colored (matching the vest)\n\nLeather lacing is incorporated under the buckles\n\nA leather piece is sewn under the lacing","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9109-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9122","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-jacket-with-snap-fasteners-pcp-lv-9122","name":"Men's Motorcycle Jacket with Snap Fasteners","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe jacket is woven with leather cords\n\nTwo outer pockets with snap fasteners\n\nTwo inner pockets\n\nSnap fasteners\n\nNo annoying back seam\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9122-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9119","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-a-laser-printed-eagle-pcp-lv-9119","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with a Laser-Printed Eagle","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\n1.2 mm thick\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nLaced on both sides\n\n2 exterior pockets\n\n2 interior pockets\n\nPolyester lining\n\nThe motif is engraved into the leather\n\nLIVE TO RIDE LOGO\n\nFor a unique look","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9119-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-925","slug":"rockerbilly-leather-vest-pcp-lv-925","name":"Rockerbilly Leather Vest","ca