 has been finished with white borders\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can extend the vest by up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be cared for with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather stays supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-917-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-916","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-red-trim-pcp-lv-916","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Red Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with red trim\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-916-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-923","slug":"men-s-zippered-leather-biker-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-923","name":"Men's Zippered Leather Biker Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features a leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has a zipper closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-923-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-974","slug":"crocodile-motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-974","name":"Crocodile Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This men's leather vest is made of genuine and durable cowhide.\n\nThe crocodile pattern is embossed into the leather.\n\nThe vest is laced on both sides.\n\nIdeal for patches, so there's no center back seam.\n\nThe inside pockets are slightly deeper, allowing the patches to fit on the front of the chest without having to sew the inside pocket.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThree chrome buckles close the vest.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides.\n\nPlease refer to the size chart in the images.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-974-1.jpg"],"featured":false