.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9102-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9186","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-expandable-zipper-pcp-lv-9186","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Expandable Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe leather is braided on the sides for a unique look.\n\nThe vest can be expanded by 5 cm on each side thanks to the zipper.\n\n2 outside pockets / 2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is ideal for patches.\n\nNo annoying center back seam.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9186-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-999","slug":"snap-button-biker-leather-vest-with-braided-cords-pcp-lv-999","name":"Snap-Button Biker Leather Vest with Braided Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest closes with snap buttons.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nLaced at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-999-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-909","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-pockets-and-buckle-closure-pcp-lv-909","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Pockets and Buckle Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust buffalo nubuck leather, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and finished with black leather cord\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as a closure\n\n2 large outer pockets\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-909-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-908","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-pockets-and-buckle-closure-pcp-lv-908","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Pockets and Buckle Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and finished with black leather cord\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as a closure\n\n2 large outer pockets\n\nOne chest pocket\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-908-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9170","slug":"antique-leather-vest-biker-jacket-made-of-genuine-leather-pcp-lv-9170","name":"Antique Leather Vest Biker Jacket Made of Genuine Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest / Jacket\n\nThe leather is made of genuine nappa cowhide\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nVery comfortable to wear\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe surface was dyed black and then lightly scraped while drying\n\nFor a unique used look\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather jacket has been finished with a leather strap around the edges\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides\n\nIdeal for patches\n\n2 outer pockets with snap fasteners\n\n2 inner pockets, one with a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles/carabiners as closures\n\nAll closures are firmly riveted through the leather","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9170-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-906","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-blue-cords-pcp-lv-906","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Blue Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with blue leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-906-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-905","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-yellow-trim-pcp-lv-905","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Yellow Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and finished with yellow leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-905-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9108","slug":"brown-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9108","name":"Brown Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe vest is woven with leather cords all around\n\nTwo regular slit outer pockets\n\nTwo breast pockets with snap fasteners\n\nTwo zippered inner pockets\n\nTwo large inner pockets\n\nTwo small inner pockets\n\nThree brass snap hooks for closure\n\nA total of 16 buckles\n\n5 buckles on each side\n\n3 buckles on each shoulder\n\nAll buckles and buttons are brass colored (matching the vest)\n\nLeather lacing is incorporated under the buckles\n\nA leather piece is sewn under the lacing","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9108-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-985","slug":"snap-button-biker-leather-vest-with-side-closure-pcp-lv-985","name":"Snap-button biker leather vest with side closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest closes with snap buttons.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nClosed at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-985-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-903","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-vest-with-large-pockets-pcp-lv-903","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Vest with Large Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cording\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nTwo large outer pockets with snap fasteners\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-903-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-983","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-snap-fastener-pcp-lv-983","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Snap Fastener","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest closes with snap fasteners.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides (so the hood can also be worn over a jacket).","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-983-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-901","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-red-cords-pcp-lv-901","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Red Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe vest is black and has been finished with red leather cords.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVery simple and easy to care for.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTwo outer pockets.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-901-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9218","slug":"motorcycle-camo-leather-vest-in-perforated-leather-pcp-lv-9218","name":"Motorcycle Camo Leather Vest in Perforated Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This leather vest is made of genuine cowhide leather.\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe main body is made of perforated leather.\n\nDyed in a camouflage pattern.\n\n3 hook-and-loop fasteners on the sides for width adjustment.\n\n2 zippered chest pockets.\n\n2 zippered side pockets.\n\n2 inside pockets.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9218-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-929","slug":"biker-leather-vest-inside-and-out-made-of-genuine-cowhide-pcp-lv-929","name":"Biker leather vest inside and out made of genuine cowhide","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has a leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest is laced on both sides, so you can also wear it over your jacket.\n\nThe vest is fastened on both sides.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outside pockets and two deep inside pockets, both with zippers.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of genuine cowhide.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-929-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-926","slug":"biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-926","name":"Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has a leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of 100% genuine cowhide.\n\nThey have a zipper closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets and two deep inner pockets, both with zippers.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-926-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9025","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-side-zippers-pcp-lv-9025","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Side Zippers","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and finished with leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc.\n\nThe leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9025-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-951","slug":"men-s-genuine-cowhide-leather-vest-pcp-lv-951","name":"Men's Genuine Cowhide Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest closes with four strong snap fasteners.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-951-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9210","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-motorcycle-club-vest-pcp-lv-9210","name":"Men's Leather Vest Hunter Motorcycle Club Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide and buffalo nubuck leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe upper part is quilted with a check pattern and is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nA polyester filling is sewn under the quilting to make the pattern more visible.\n\nThe lower part is made of perforated buffalo nubuck leather in matte black.\n\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closures.\n\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper).\n\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly deeper.\n\nTo accommodate the patches on the front.\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers.\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side.\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm.\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9210-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9005","slug":"snap-button-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-9005","name":"Snap-Button Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nBlack base color.\n\nLaced on both sides.\n\nSnap-button closure.\n\nTwo exterior pockets.\n\nTwo interior pockets, one with a zipper.\n\nNo center back seam, ideal for patches.\n\nInner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9005-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-919","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-patch-pockets-pcp-lv-919","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Patch Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-919-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9114","slug":"men-s-jeans-biker-leather-vest-with-side-expandability-pcp-lv-9114","name":"Men's Jeans Biker Leather Vest with Side Expandability","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine Nappa Leather\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest is expandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over a jacket\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 of which are chest pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one with a zipper\n\nAll zippers are from YKK\n\nPlease refer to the size chart","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9114-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9189","slug":"custom-nubuck-leather-biker-vest-with-