 patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam at the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9213-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9209","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-club-matte-black-pcp-lv-9209","name":"Men's Leather Vest Hunter Club Matte Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine buffalo nubuck leather in matte black\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe upper part is quilted with a check pattern\n\nA polyester filling is sewn under the quilting to make the pattern more visible\n\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closures\n\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper)\n\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches on the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9209-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9181","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-inside-and-out-made-of-genuine-leather-pcp-lv-9181","name":"Men's Leather Vest, Inside and Out, Made of Genuine Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Men's leather vest made of genuine cowhide leather (inside and out)\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThat's a total thickness of 2.2 to 2.4 mm